0 Lender Covenants","originalSheet":null,"kind":"covenants","moneyColumns":[],"moneyCells":["C3","C4"]},{"source":"06 Lender/Harrow Point Loan Agreement - Section 7 Covenants.pdf","locator":"Page 1","sha256":"91be86749b2cd01e2a80634a0c09430eabed7f93d9e55c3e6f9b7070b03c9196","name":"LND Page 1","originalSheet":null,"kind":"covenants","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"06 Lender/Harrow Point Loan Agreement - Section 7 Covenants.pdf","locator":"Page 2","sha256":"91be86749b2cd01e2a80634a0c09430eabed7f93d9e55c3e6f9b7070b03c9196","name":"LND Page 2","originalSheet":null,"kind":"covenants","moneyColumns":[]},{"source":"07 Procedures/HANGS Reporting Procedures v1.3.docx","locator":"Clauses REPORT-1 to REPORT-7; Appendix A, the statement mapping","sha256":"6ca5149801a1ea92cfb37a39671713f743c6863bf8dc984b2f800ab0982e11d2","name":"E11 Reporting Procedures","originalSheet":null,"kind":"procedures","moneyColumns":[]}],"openItems":[{"id":"Current Portion of Long-Term Debt · REPORT-4","status":"open","amount":"62000.00","explanation":"GL 2350 carries the whole $248,000.00 equipment note; $62,000.00 of principal is due within twelve months. The Ridgeway Equipment Finance note was interest only through September 30, 2026. Its first principal installment is due December 31, 2026, and 4 installments of $15,500.00 fall due by October 31, 2027. Under REPORT-4, RC-01 presents $62,000.00 as the current portion of long-term debt and $186,000.00 as long-term. It is a presentation reclassification, not a journal entry. The September comparative is presented the same way ($62,000.00); the September package showed the note as long-term only. The Harrow Point Lending construction loan has no principal due before June 30, 2028."},{"id":"Variance Without an Explanation · REPORT-3","status":"open","amount":"8385.06","explanation":"6300 Repairs & Maintenance is $8,385.06 over budget for October, 139.8%, and no explanation is on file. October actual $14,385.06 against a budget of $6,000.00. Under REPORT-3 a variance of more than $5,000 and more than 10% needs the line owner's written explanation before release. The explanations file has 6 lines; none is for 6300. 6 of the 7 variances over the threshold are explained. The package keeps this line marked Explanation Needed until one is added."},{"id":"New Job Without a Budget Line · REPORT-5","status":"open","amount":"86540.00","explanation":"Job 27-07 Alder Court Townhomes has $86,540.00 of cost this year and no line in the FY2027 budget. The job cost report lists job 27-07 (Started October 12, 2026) with $86,540.00 of cost added. The approved FY2027 budget has job budget lines for 27-04, 27-05 only, so this job's spending cannot be measured against anything. Job cost still ties to GL 1400 at $6,890,445.50. Under REPORT-5 the job is reported to the Controller; an approved budget line is needed before November's package."},{"id":"Covenant Headroom Under 10% · REPORT-6","status":"open","amount":"155463.48","explanation":"Maximum Leverage Ratio is 1.43 to 1.00 against a maximum of 1.50 to 1.00: headroom 4.5%. Total liabilities $4,952,721.53 over tangible net worth $3,457,277.83, which is partners' capital $3,515,527.83 less the $58,250.00 due from HANGS Property Holdings LLC, as the lender defines it. At these liabilities the covenant needs tangible net worth of $3,301,814.35, so net worth could fall by only $155,463.48 before it is breached. Headroom of 4.5% is under REPORT-6's 10%, so the Controller is warned before the compliance certificate goes to Harrow Point Lending. The covenant is met; nothing is sent."}],"incomplete":true,"research":null}